CHAPTER.VERS:
Outside the veil of the testimony, in the tent of meeting, Aaron will keep it in order from evening to morning before Yahweh continually: it will be a statute forever throughout your

          {+}
         generations.

You

          {+}
         will have one manner of law, as well for the sojourner, as for the home-born: for I am Yahweh your

          {+}
         God.
